    "Student organisations | Univerzita Pardubice\nPřejít k hlavnímu obsahu\nStudent organisations\nLooking to pursue your passion together with your fellow students? Join one of our many clubs.\nThe Student Council, SRUPa\nThe Student Board (\"SRUPa\") is a group of student-elected senators who take care of the communication between the students and the university. Whether it´s an obstacle in your study path or the dorm system treating you unfairly, these are the people to contact if you find yourself not knowing what to do. They are also responsible for charity events, game nights and other fun events at the university.\nhttp://srupa.upce.cz/\nsrupa@upce.cz\nFacebook:\nstudentskaradaupce\nErasmus Student Network (Buddy Programme)\nThe Buddy Programme\nis the initiative of University students focusing on providing assistance to international students at the University of Pardubice. The students organise parties and trips for international students, help them with their first steps in Pardubice, and more. Contact us:\nhr@esn.upce.cz\nUniversity choir\nIf you have a passion for music, performing and socialising, the University choir is for you. With a repertoire spanning classical, jazz, soul, gospel and pop there is never a dull moment. The choir is made up of students, faculty, alumni and members of the public and performs several times per year. They also spend time in the recording studio, having already recorded 4 albums.\nNew members are welcome. If you'd like to join, email vus@vus.upce.cz\nThe Duke of Edinburgh's International Award\nThis educational programme for young people was founded by Prince Philip, the Duke of Edinburgh. Participating in the Award is, above all, a personal challenge. Each participant has the opportunity to see themselves as a unique personality, which we all undoubtedly all are. The participant is guided to set personal goals and then to meet a number of pre-determined challenges under the leadership of experienced leaders or trainers of the programme.\nFor more information visit\nDofE website\nor contact the\nuniversity coordinator\n.\nInternational Union of Students of Business and Economic Schools (AIESEC)\nThe International Union of Students of Business and Economic Schools (AIESEC) - is the world’s largest student, non-profit educational organisation.\nAIESEC organises events for students.\nNewsletter pro uchazeče\nEmail\nVaše e-mailová adresa.\nMějte přehled o našich novinkách!\nLeave this field blank\nUniverzita Pardubice\nFakulty\nUniverzita Pardubice\nDopravní fakulta Jana Pernera\nFakulta ekonomicko-správní\nFakulta elektrotechniky a informatiky\nFakulta chemicko-technologická\nFakulta filozofická\nFakulta restaurování\nFakulta zdravotnických studií\nSoučásti\nUniverzitní knihovna\nKatedra tělovýchovy a sportu\nJazykové centrum\nKoleje a menza\nUniverzitní konferenční centrum\nCentrum transferu technologií a znalostí\nKariérní centrum\nJak nás najdete?\nUniverzita\nVolná místa\nVyhledávání zaměstnanců\nÚřední deska\nKontakty\nVirtuální prohlídka\nSlužby\nUbytování a stravování\nProdej odborné literatury a skript\nKnihovna\nSportovní aktivity\nVydavatelství\nE-shop\nEuropean University Alliance\n© 2023\nUniverzita Pardubice\n,\nStudentská 95\n,\n532 10\nPardubice 2\nTelefon:\n466 036 111, 466 036 112, 466 036 113\nSprávce webu\n,\nRSS\nID datové schránky:\nf5vj9hu\nProhlášení o přístupnosti\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 CZ"
